matrix Matrix([[exp(u/2)*exp(v/2)*cosh(r/2), exp(u/2)*exp(-v/2)*sinh(r/2)], [exp(-u/2)*exp(v/2)*sinh(r/2), exp(-u/2)*exp(-v/2)*cosh(r/2)]])
distance invariant ad+bc=cosh(r) PASS
source foot exp(2u)=ab/cd; target shift exp(2v)=ac/bd PASS
Haar Jacobian in fixed Lie algebra basis -sinh(r)/2 - cosh(r)*tanh(r/2)/2 - tanh(r/2)/2
Haar density is constant times sinh(r) du dr dv PASS
